The module library of speech-dispatcher 0.12.1 (src/modules: module_main.c,
module_readline.c, module_process.c, spd_module_main.h), BSD-2-Clause,
Copyright Samuel Thibault. speech-dispatcher installs it as libspeechd_module
since 0.12.0; meson.build builds this copy only for older releases (noble has
0.12.0~rc2, which has the same code but does not install it).
